      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving understandability.Now let me check the working directory for the compile script.Now I have a clear picture. I'll write the improved test with these understandability enhancements:\n1. Remove all unused imports (many are imported but never used)\n2. Remove unused `CHARSET_UTF8` constant\n3. Rename `BOUND` → `MAX_DATA_LENGTH` (clarifies its meaning)\n4. Eliminate `AtomicInteger` in the helper — the parameter `i` is already final, so the wrapper is pointless\n5. Use descriptive variable names (`encoded`/`decoded` vs `enc`/`dec`)\n6. Convert the loop to a `@ParameterizedTest` to make each fill-byte case independently visible and reportable`COMPILE_OK` — the improved test compiled successfully."
